  "text": "### Step 3: Resolution (Days 5–8)  \n**Possible Outcomes:**  \n**If FirstUK Bank at Fault:**\n- Full financial compensation for loss\n- Plus interest (8% per annum) if appropriate\n- Plus additional compensation if distress caused\n- Written apology\n- Process improvement (to prevent recurrence)  \n**If Customer at Fault:**\n- Explanation of policy/procedure\n- Evidence provided\n- Polite decline of compensation\n- Educational tone (help customer understand)  \n**If Unclear/Inconclusive:**\n- Explain evidence reviewed\n- Acknowledge customer perspective\n- Offer partial compensation (if appropriate)\n- Explain further steps (e.g., external ombudsman)",
